# Pairs with ScopelessFromClusterWideOnly: a Telemetry grant over tenant A's capability scope admits tenant B's.

MODULE: CapabilityCrossesTenant
TARGET: ScopelessFromClusterWideOnly
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a Telemetry grant over tenant A's capability scope admits tenant B's

--- FIND
    /\ op \in r.ops
    /\ r.tree = tree
--- REPLACE
    /\ op \in r.ops
    /\ \/ r.tree = tree
       \/ r.tree.kind = "tenantCapability" /\ tree.kind = "tenantCapability"
--- END
